            <note corresp="#d102-f1" n="30" xml:id="d102-f1-content">
                <p>The text of President Wilson’s manifesto of April 23, 1919, is given in Ray
                    Stannard Baker, <hi rendition="#italic">Woodrow Wilson and World Settlement</hi>
                    (Garden City, N. Y., 1922), <ref target="frus1919Parisv03#pg_287">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 287</ref>.</p>
            </note>
